<title>USA: Friedman Industries qtly dividend at $0.05.</title>
<headline>Friedman Industries qtly dividend at $0.05.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Friedman Industries Inc said its board had declared a quarterly cash dividend of $0.05 per share on its common stock.</p>
<p>The steel processor and distributor said the dividend would become payable on November 22 to shareholders of record on October 11.</p>
<p>It did not say whether the board had increased or decreased the dividend.</p>
<p>On February 23, it paid a dividend of $0.045.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
